Scope note
----------
The MIT terms above apply to the source code in this repository
(`sqlshield/`, `scripts/`, `tests/`, `figures/`).

Author-generated content under `results/` -- model predictions, scores,
labels, confusion counts, statistical test outputs, cluster identifiers,
training histories, and derived evaluation summaries -- is released under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Any source-query text reproduced inside those files (the `text` column of the
prediction CSVs, and the query strings quoted in `results/error_analysis/`) is
NOT author-generated and is NOT relicensed here. It originates from the two
Kaggle corpora below and remains subject to the terms of their original
publishers:
  - sajid576/sql-injection-dataset
  - syedsaqlainhussain/sql-injection-dataset

The raw corpora themselves are not redistributed as datasets; users obtain them
directly from Kaggle. Users who redistribute the prediction files should satisfy
themselves that reproducing the included query text is permitted by those terms.

Pretrained model weights (microsoft/codebert-base, bert-base-uncased) remain
subject to their respective upstream licenses.
